title: "symphony-dt: Bayesian digital twins of Parkinson's disease progression"
abstract: >-
  A toolkit for building, checking, calibrating, forecasting with and auditing Bayesian hierarchical
  state-space digital twins on longitudinal clinical cohorts, with the frozen SYMPHONY v2 model of
  Parkinson's disease progression.
type: software
